-- D144: child's maintenance not on the parent: 0.
#ASSERT `fid para (1) points of` (`fid single parent in 2026 with` (LIST `fid child born` 2020 `fid parent asked is` `the mother of the child` `fid maintained` FALSE `fid with parent` TRUE `fid other parent died` FALSE `fid one parent unregistered` FALSE `fid mother elects` FALSE `fid other resident` FALSE `fid other has (1)` FALSE)) EQUALS 0

