-- A father living apart, not entitled under (1), bearing a share of the children's maintenance.
GIVEN `share` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A parent in a tax year, for section 40(b)`
`fid father living apart bearing` `share` MEANS
    `fid parent in` 2026 `fid parent resident` TRUE `fid single-parent family parent` FALSE `fid s37 entitled` FALSE `fid living apart` TRUE `fid maintenance share` `share`
        `fid children` (LIST `fid child born` 2016 `fid parent asked is` `the father of the child` `fid maintained` FALSE `fid with parent` FALSE `fid other parent died` FALSE `fid one parent unregistered` FALSE `fid mother elects` FALSE `fid other resident` TRUE `fid other has (1)` TRUE)

