#ASSERT `fid para (2) points of` (`fid father living apart bearing` 0) EQUALS 0

§§ `H-I. Sections 45A and 47`

GIVEN `life`         IS A NUMBER
      `pension`      IS A NUMBER
      `survivors`    IS A NUMBER
      `child life`   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 45A`
`fid 45A sums: life` `life` `fid pension` `pension` `fid survivors` `survivors` `fid child life` `child life` MEANS
    `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 45A` WITH
        `for insurance of the individual's or the spouse's life with an insurance company`  IS `life`
        `to a pension provident fund`                                                       IS `pension`
        `to the State, a local authority or a designated body, to keep a pension right`     IS 0
        `for survivors' pension insurance`                                                  IS `survivors`
        `for the life insurance of a child aged 18 or more`                                 IS `child life`
        `to a provident fund, or to keep pension rights, for a child aged 18 or more`       IS 0
        `of the pension sums above, those paid in respect of income not from work`          IS 0

GIVEN `not beneficiary` IS A NUMBER
      `beneficiary`     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 47`
`fid 47 sums: under (b)` `not beneficiary` `fid under (b1)` `beneficiary` MEANS
    `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 47` WITH
        `to a pension provident fund only, by the individual or the spouse, for the benefit of one of them`  IS `not beneficiary`
        `to the State, a local authority or a designated body, to keep the pension right of one of them`    IS 0
        `to a pension provident fund, by the individual or the spouse, for the benefit of the beneficiary member` IS `beneficiary`
        `to a pension provident fund, by the beneficiary member, for the benefit of a child aged 18 or more` IS 0

GIVEN `resident`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `work`      IS A NUMBER
      `other`     IS A NUMBER
      `business`  IS A NUMBER
      `insured`   IS A NUMBER
      `deposits`  IS A NUMBER
      `s45`       IS A `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 45A`
      `s47`       IS A `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 47`
      `deducted`  IS A NUMBER
      `f sums`    IS A NUMBER
      `s32`       IS A BOOLEAN
      `class`     IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
`fid earner 2026: resident` `resident` `fid work` `work` `fid other` `other` `fid business` `business` `fid insured` `insured` `fid paid for him` `deposits` `fid sums 45A` `s45` `fid sums 47` `s47` `fid deducted` `deducted` `fid (f) deposits` `f sums` `fid s 32(14)(b)` `s32` `fid s 47(d) class` `class` MEANS
    `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47` WITH
        `tax year`                                                                      IS 2026
        `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                           IS `resident`
        `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`     IS `work`
        `taxable income not from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A` IS `other`
        `taxable income from a business or profession`                                  IS `business`
        `insured income`                                                                IS `insured`
        `sums paid in the tax year to a pension provident fund in respect of the individual's income` IS `deposits`
        `sums paid, for section 45A`                                                    IS `s45`
        `sums paid, for section 47`                                                     IS `s47`
        `sums deducted under section 47(b) or (b1)`                                     IS `deducted`
        `sums deposited to a pension provident fund as a self-employed member for himself, not credited under section 45A(b)` IS `f sums`
        `a deduction was made for him under section 32(14)(b) for preferred insurance against loss of working capacity`      IS `s32`
        `within a class for which regulations under section 47(d) set higher deductions`                                    IS `class`
        `a foreign worker`                                                                                                  IS FALSE

-- An employee whose salary is all insured income; not a beneficiary member unless the deposits
-- for him reach 26,436.48.
GIVEN `resident` IS A BOOLEAN
      `salary`   IS A NUMBER
      `deposits` IS A NUMBER
      `s45`      IS A `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 45A`
      `p47`      IS A NUMBER
      `deducted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
`fid employee: resident` `resident` `fid insured salary` `salary` `fid deposits for him` `deposits` `fid 45A sums` `s45` `fid 47(b) sums` `p47` `fid already deducted` `deducted` MEANS
    `fid earner 2026: resident` `resident` `fid work` `salary` `fid other` 0 `fid business` 0 `fid insured` `salary` `fid paid for him` `deposits` `fid sums 45A` `s45` `fid sums 47` (`fid 47 sums: under (b)` `p47` `fid under (b1)` 0) `fid deducted` `deducted` `fid (f) deposits` 0 `fid s 32(14)(b)` FALSE `fid s 47(d) class` FALSE

-- A self-employed individual, no work income, not a beneficiary member unless deposits reach the threshold.
GIVEN `income`   IS A NUMBER
      `paid`     IS A NUMBER
      `deducted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
`fid self-employed on` `income` `fid paying` `paid` `fid with deducted` `deducted` MEANS
    `fid earner 2026: resident` TRUE `fid work` 0 `fid other` `income` `fid business` `income` `fid insured` 0 `fid paid for him` `paid` `fid sums 45A` (`fid 45A sums: life` 0 `fid pension` `paid` `fid survivors` 0 `fid child life` 0) `fid sums 47` (`fid 47 sums: under (b)` `paid` `fid under (b1)` 0) `fid deducted` `deducted` `fid (f) deposits` 0 `fid s 32(14)(b)` FALSE `fid s 47(d) class` FALSE

-- D180: employee, not beneficiary, 100,000 insured, pays 6,000 pension; s 47 deduction nil: credit 2,100.
#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid employee: resident` TRUE `fid insured salary` 100000 `fid deposits for him` 18000 `fid 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 0 `fid pension` 6000 `fid survivors` 0 `fid child life` 0) `fid 47(b) sums` 6000 `fid already deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 2100
-- D181: 200,000 insured, pays 12,000: base 8,148, credit 2,851.80.
#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid employee: resident` TRUE `fid insured salary` 200000 `fid deposits for him` 20000 `fid 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 0 `fid pension` 12000 `fid survivors` 0 `fid child life` 0) `fid 47(b) sums` 12000 `fid already deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 2851.80
-- D182: 20,000 insured, pays 1,800: the 2,268 floor; credit 630.
#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid employee: resident` TRUE `fid insured salary` 20000 `fid deposits for him` 5000 `fid 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 0 `fid pension` 1800 `fid survivors` 0 `fid child life` 0) `fid 47(b) sums` 1800 `fid already deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 630
-- D183: 100,000 insured, pays only life insurance 6,000, resident: base 5,000 (5% proviso), credit 1,250.
#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid employee: resident` TRUE `fid insured salary` 100000 `fid deposits for him` 12500 `fid 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 6000 `fid pension` 0 `fid survivors` 0 `fid child life` 0) `fid 47(b) sums` 0 `fid already deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 1250
-- D184: the same, not resident: 0.
#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid employee: resident` FALSE `fid insured salary` 100000 `fid deposits for him` 12500 `fid 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 6000 `fid pension` 0 `fid survivors` 0 `fid child life` 0) `fid 47(b) sums` 0 `fid already deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 0
-- D185: not resident, 100,000 insured in Israel, pays 6,000 pension: 2,100 ((b) has no residence condition).
#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid employee: resident` FALSE `fid insured salary` 100000 `fid deposits for him` 18000 `fid 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 0 `fid pension` 6000 `fid survivors` 0 `fid child life` 0) `fid 47(b) sums` 6000 `fid already deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 2100
-- D186: survivors' pension insurance 2,000 only: floor 2,268 higher; base 2,000; credit 700.
#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid employee: resident` TRUE `fid insured salary` 100000 `fid deposits for him` 12500 `fid 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 0 `fid pension` 0 `fid survivors` 2000 `fid child life` 0) `fid 47(b) sums` 0 `fid already deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 700
-- D187: survivors' pension insurance 5,000 only: (d)(2) gives 1,500, floor 2,268; base 2,268; credit 793.80.
#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid employee: resident` TRUE `fid insured salary` 100000 `fid deposits for him` 12500 `fid 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 0 `fid pension` 0 `fid survivors` 5000 `fid child life` 0) `fid 47(b) sums` 0 `fid already deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 793.80

-- D188: self-employed, 100,000, pays 20,000: s 47(b) deduction 11,000 (D240); (a)-(e) credit 1,750.
#ASSERT `the deduction under section 47 for` (`fid self-employed on` 100000 `fid paying` 20000 `fid with deducted` 0) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 11000
#ASSERT `s 45A(a)-(e) — the credit for insurance premiums and pension contributions, for` (`fid self-employed on` 100000 `fid paying` 20000 `fid with deducted` 11000) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 1750
-- D189: pays 12,000: deduction 7,000; credit 1,750.
