#ASSERT `the credit under section 45A for` (`fid beneficiary employee on 150,000 with 45A sums` (`fid 45A sums: life` 0 `fid pension` 10000 `fid survivors` 0 `fid child life` 0) `fid and (b1) sums` 10000) `, at` `fid amounts 2026` EQUALS 2851.80

